<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Jan 6.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Monday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day (upto 0820 GMT) and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at (0820 GMT) was 3266.02, 2.02 points or 0.06 percent higher than Friday's close.</p>
<p>.</p>
